        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Sollathaan Ninaikkiren, Sundara Swapnagalu\n- People: K. Balachander, Kamal Haasan, Sivakumar, S. V. Subbaiah, Jayachitra, Srividya, Shubha, Jayasudha\n- Topics: Tamil cinema, film remakes\n\nFacts:\n- Kamal Haasan was born on 7 November 1954.\n- Kamal Haasan is an Indian film actor, director, screenwriter, producer, playback singer, and lyricist who works primarily in Tamil cinema.\n- Sollathaan Ninaikkiren is a 1973 Tamil-language film.\n- K. Balachander scripted and directed Sollathaan Ninaikkiren.\n- Sollathaan Ninaikkiren stars Sivakumar, S. V. Subbaiah, Jayachitra, Srividya, Shubha, Kamal Haasan, and Jayasudha in the lead roles.\n- Sundara Swapnagalu was a remake of K. Balachander's own Tamil film Sollathaan Ninaikkiren.",
